  "description": "Functions to decode Base64 encoded strings to plain text using DAX",
  "tags": "DAX,Base64,Encoding,String,Decode",
  "releaseNotes": "Performance improvement: EG.Base64.Decode is now a single self-contained function that maps Base64 characters to 6-bit values with FIND against the alphabet string, instead of the previous SWITCH-based helper functions (EG.Base64.ConvertASCII and EG.Base64.BytePartition, both removed).",
